+goes through memory on Xenon (about 40 cycles), so the one-time splat of
+a loop invariant or the final extract of a reduction would exceed what
+the @samp{very-cheap} model allows for any trip count.  @option{-Os} and
+an explicit @option{-fvect-cost-model} are not affected.
 
